    The registered refusal fired: A < 4E, so the two competing models are
    closer than the estimator can separate. Registered consequence: THIS
    IS THE RESULT and the arm is NOT re-run at a larger n -- sizing until
    the classifier stops refusing is fitting the design to the verdict.

